t":"16f24d4a9705088cc89c5f43840484f8e2c09525b295cce8ab20b007a2ad3293","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5k.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":183},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"d7ef6a4bb8e107bade7351c2f60878a7f4083df940889de103cc683d7191d74f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5k.1/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":7628},"state":{"digest":"de6f6fcc547c6e0bd1119e3137d1c71b36a824f6a15e4248c1361460ce7e98be","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5k.1/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-10-07T19:06:05.413451+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5k.1","local_name":"bob-cli-5k.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-5k","agent_clan_generation":"20261007144115","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-5k.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-5k[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Close the ten highest-impact bob-cli task beads[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every bead in the 48-hour impact ranking (bob-cli-4j, 2e, 21, 33, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]59, 4m, 4x, 4r, 4u, 3c) is implemented, verified on the final [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]master tree, and closed before this epic lands. As a result, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]master's test gate is honest and green: `just check` runs every [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]test binary and passes twice in a row on athena. The artifact-link [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]store accepts writes again. Native Tasks queries no longer fail on [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the 2 s sandbox deadline. A bare plugin sync can no longer roll [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]back the vault. The zorg-era reading records are in the reference [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]library.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]close_top_ten_impact_beads.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/close_top_ten_impact_beads.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-5k[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-5k/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fix the deterministic red tests[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]red-tests[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]red-tests: give `ref create --audio` a completion decision (bob-cli-4j),[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]confirm the stale `clip` help snapshot is fixed (bob-cli-5i), and make [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the listen-card test accept both Pandoc ampersand escapings without [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]losing URI coverage (bob-cli-4u); close all three.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop lib tests from racing on process environment[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]env-isolation[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]env-isolation: replace every module-private env-mutating test helper [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with one shared isolation mechanism that never lets a test see another [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]test's BOB_DAY_FILE or BOB_NOW, enforce it with clippy, stress-test it, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and close bob-cli-2e, bob-cli-40 (superseded) and bob-cli-5c.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add the canonical just check gate[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]check-gate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after red-tests, env-isolation[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]check-gate: add `just check` (fmt, clippy, and every test binary with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]--no-fail-fast), make `just test` stop masking binaries, clear any [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]remaining clippy deny or environment-dependent CLI test, document the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate, prove it green twice, and close bob-cli-3c.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Repair the artifact-link event store[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]link-store[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]link-store: plan and run a backed-up data repair of the colliding [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]operation_id events in the plans sidecar so `sase artifact doctor` is [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]healthy and typed links write again, backfill the relations kept as free[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]text, propose the sase hardening as follow-ups, and close bob-cli-21.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Build the Tasks JS sandbox only when a query needs it[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tasks-sandbox[dim] · [dim][/dim]after check-gate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tasks-sandbox: construct the Tasks JavaScript sandbox lazily and give [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]its initialization its own budget apart from the 2 s per-expression [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deadline, add regression tests, measure before/after latency on the live[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]read path, and close bob-cli-33.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Refuse bare plugin syncs from a different bob-plugins checkout[bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]plugins-sync-guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]after check-gate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins-sync-guard: make `bob plugins sync` without `--repo` abort [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]before any pull or copy when run from inside a bob-plugins checkout [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]other than the resolved repo, test it, document the rule in bob-cli and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-plugins AGENTS.md, and close bob-cli-59.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Migrate zorg-era reading records into the reference library[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold white on #AF5FFF] xlarge [/bold white on #AF5FFF]\n    [#AF87FF]ref-migration[dim] · [dim][/dim]after check-gate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ref-migration: settle the migration design with Bryan, author and drive [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a nested epic that moves the ~424 unindexed zorg-era reading records [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into `ref/` through a dry-run-first, idempotent, reversible vault write,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and close bob-cli-4x once `bob ref doctor` coverage confirms it.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-5k","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-5k.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-e191d8304c63c8e051b9fc62f603e758","started_at":"2026-10-07T18:48:36.698559+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"139058bbdc41ce49a39d6b95a7f0b4e982e9dcae1fb17d231fb121f85e40e7e7","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5k.7--plan/chat.md","size_bytes":9625},"commits":{"digest":"c7e50562d1e2f35c55ad9042a6b22edca7c11e61eba48075f89758435a57863a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5k.7--plan/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5k.7--plan/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"5932e82af72eafef5f169dfd2e09315fb416e5cfdac501df558ab3db920d244d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5k.7--plan/m